    },
    {
      "subId": "7221503",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Neko",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722150301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722150301": {
            "id": "722150301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Have you hung them all up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150302"
            ]
          },
          "722150302": {
            "id": "722150302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "All done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150303"
            ]
          },
          "722150303": {
            "id": "722150303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Meow meow, wonderful. This will surely make the shrine a livelier place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150304"
            ]
          },
          "722150304": {
            "id": "722150304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150305"
            ]
          },
          "722150305": {
            "id": "722150305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Hmm. Why haven't lots of humans come here yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150308"
            ]
          },
          "722150308": {
            "id": "722150308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Ah, humans are so hard to understand. Well, you are an exception, of course. You are more enlightened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150309"
            ]
          },
          "722150309": {
            "id": "722150309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "There may not be any people now... But at least those little rascals won't get lost anymore, meow meow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150310"
            ]
          },
          "722150310": {
            "id": "722150310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "The stone human says that the stone will be ready very soon. Do come and see it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150311"
            ]
          },
          "722150311": {
            "id": "722150311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "...Hmm, yes, there was one other thing. A strange thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150312"
            ]
          },
          "722150312": {
            "id": "722150312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "I went to ask those two green humans about Hibiki and Domeki.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150313"
            ]
          },
          "722150313": {
            "id": "722150313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Both of them said that they didn't know Hibiki or anything about her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150314"
            ]
          },
          "722150314": {
            "id": "722150314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "But the tall green human said that he had read about an \"Ako Domeki.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150315"
            ]
          },
          "722150315": {
            "id": "722150315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "He talked about... \"bandit\" this and \"bounty\" that... Whatever the case, he was trying to say that Domeki was a bad person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150316"
            ]
          },
          "722150316": {
            "id": "722150316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "There must be some mistake. Hibiki would always play with him, so Domeki must've been a good person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150317"
            ]
          },
          "722150317": {
            "id": "722150317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "That human's comprehension must be lacking. You're still the most reliable human after all, it seems...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722150318"
            ]
          },
          "722150318": {
            "id": "722150318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Ah, when will Hibiki come back..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}